Subject: [PATCH 5/5] C4: server-side brand-aware image prompt assembly
 (subject-only agents)

create_agent_artifact_job's prompt becomes SUBJECT-only for image-GENERATION
jobs: when the owning site carries a brandImagery contract (W16 C1),
Platform -- the trusted bridge, exactly like the storage grant -- appends
the site's styleDescriptors to the agent's subject, merges negativeDescriptors
into the negative prompt, and forwards seed/seedStrategy/styleRef/loras from
the site record, overriding (never erroring on) any agent-supplied
generation-control fields and reporting which ones lost in the response's
overriddenFields. A site with no brandImagery passes every field through
unchanged; PDF/template jobs and image edits are untouched.

